{"title":"国开行发放贷款686亿元！支持国家水网建设","date":"2024-07-09","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">国开行发放贷款<span lang=\"EN-US\">686</span>亿元！支持国家水网建设</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:33.6pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋;\r\ncolor:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">近日，从国家开发银行了解到，上半年国开行加大力度支持构建国家水网，</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:\r\nminor-bidi;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\nZH-CN;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">发放水利和水资源领域贷款<span lang=\"EN-US\">686</span>亿元</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:\r\nminor-bidi;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\nZH-CN;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">，重点支持南水北调中线引江补汉、环北部湾广东和广西水资源配置、珠江三角洲水资源配置、引绰济辽、引汉济渭等一批跨流域、跨区域重大引调水工程，水利枢纽、水库、河道治理等流域防洪工程体系建设，灌区建设与改造，以及河湖生态保护治理。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:33.6pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">今年以来，国开行一方面加强与水利部政银合作，跟踪了解水利重要规划情况，精准对接重点项目融资需求，</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">为一批新开工建设的重大引调水、重点水源、新建大型灌区等水利项目提供长期限、大额度、低成本的信贷支持</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">。同时，针对今年重点推进前期工作的重大水利工程出台差异化政策，完成对黄河古贤水利枢纽工程前期贷款和中长期贷款授信，不断提升政策性开发性金融服务水利基础设施建设质效。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:33.6pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;text-align:center\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202407/123.jpg\" style=\"width: 1080px; height: 628px;\" /><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;text-align:center\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">引汉济渭工程三河口水利枢纽</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;text-align:center\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;text-align:center\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;text-align:center\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202407/234.jpg\" style=\"width: 1080px; height: 607px;\" /></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;text-align:center\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">引汉济渭工程三河口水利枢纽</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;text-align:center\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;text-align:center\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:33.6pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">除了重大项目，国开行还积极为农村供水保障项目提供普惠金融服务，</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">支持有条件的农村地区采取城镇供水管网延伸或者建设跨村、跨乡镇连片集中供水工程等方式</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">，发展规模集中供水，实现城乡同质饮水。重点支持江西、福建全省城乡供水工程。</span></p>"}